      "id": "2065041022091247873",
      "text": "Fable 5 is insane at frontend implementation.\n\nOne website screenshot became a near pixel-perfect interactive 3D dashboard.\n\n3D globe, route arcs, glass UI, motion details, all rebuilt in one pass.\n\nFable 5 genuinely blew me away.✨",
